Template: homelab-roundcube-account-menu/myaccount_url
Type: string
Default: https://myaccount.mailmasker.org
Description: Public URL of the self-service account app (myaccount.<domain>):
 Written into config.inc.php's $config['account_menu_url']. The
 "Manage your account" entry (and its security/sessions deep links)
 point the browser here. It MUST be the public, browser-reachable
 vhost of the homelab-accountmanage service -- not an internal address
 -- because it is a link the user's browser follows; the accountmanage
 app auto-logs-in through the shared SSO session, so no second password
 prompt appears. Leave the default unless this fleet serves the account
 app under a different hostname (e.g. the test environment's
 myaccount.test.mailmasker.org).

Template: homelab-roundcube-account-menu/logo_url
Type: string
Default: https://static.mailmasker.org/theme/v1/logo.svg
Description: URL of the brand logo to show above Roundcube's task rail:
 Written into config.inc.php's $config['skin_logo'], which elastic
 honours with no skin-template edit. Serving it from the shared asset
 host (static.mailmasker.org) rather than copying a file into the skin
 means a rebrand changes one file and every app -- webmail included --
 picks it up, with no package rebuild. Set to the empty string to leave
 Roundcube's own logo alone.
